an dan StandardScaler ditempatkan dalam Pipeline sehingga proses fit hanya menggunakan data latih."],"metadata":{"id":"iBnw5RdYzlx8"}},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":["**PEMODELAN**\n","\n","Sesuai Jalur B, dibuat tiga model: regresi linear sederhana, regresi linear berganda, dan DummyRegressor sebagai baseline. Regresi sederhana memakai satu fitur dengan korelasi absolut terbesar terhadap target. Perbandingan dilakukan menggunakan 5-fold cross-validation pada data latih."],"metadata":{"id":"7q_qoueyzv1u"}},{"cell_type":"code","source":["# Pilih fitur dengan korelasi absolut terbesar terhadap target (hanya dari data latih).\n","corr_train = X_train.join(y_train.rename(\"House_Price\")).corr(numeric_only=True)[\"House_Price\"].drop(\"House_Price\")\n","simple_feature = corr_train.abs().idxmax()\n","print(\"Korelasi fitur terhadap target:\")\n","display(corr_train.sort_values(key=np.abs, ascending=False).to_frame(\"Korelasi\"))\n","print(\"Fitur untuk regresi sederhana:\", simple_feature)\n","\n","simple_model = Pipeline(steps=[\n","    (\"prep\", ColumnTransformer([\n","        (\"num\", Pipeline([\n","            (\"imputer\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\")),\n","            (\"scaler\", StandardScaler())\n","        ]), [simple_feature])\n","    ])),\n","    (\"model\", LinearRegression())\n","])\n","\n","multiple_model = Pipeline(steps=[\n","    (\"prep\", preprocessor),\n","    (\"model\", LinearRegression())\n","])\n","\n","baseline_model = Pipeline(steps=[\n","    (\"prep\", preprocessor),\n","    (\"model\", DummyRegressor(strategy=\"mean\"))\n","])\n","\n","cv = KFold(n_splits=5, shuffle=True, random_state=SEED)\n","scoring = {\n","    \"MAE\": \"neg_mean_absolute_error\",\n","    \"RMSE\": \"neg_root_mean_squared_error\",\n","    \"R2\": \"r2\"\n","}\n","\n","models = {\n","    \"Regresi Linear Sederhana\": simple_model,\n","    \"Regresi Linear Berganda\": multiple_model,\n","    \"Dummy Regressor\": baseline_model\n","}\n","\n","cv_rows = []\n","for 